# BIS Standards AI Assistant — Environment Configuration

# ============================================================
# OPTION A: Gemini (Recommended for demo/presentation)
# Works with internet, no local LLM needed.
# Get free key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# ============================================================
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# ============================================================
# OPTION B: Ollama (For offline / full local setup)
# Requires: https://ollama.ai → ollama pull llama3.1
# ============================================================
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://127.0.0.1:11434
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.1

# ============================================================
# OPTION C: No LLM config (Template fallback)
# System still works — shows retrieved chunks without AI summary.
# ============================================================
